{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05750","headline":"奉和圣制三月三日 · 陈希烈","name":"奉和圣制三月三日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上巳迂龙驾，中流泛羽觞。\n酒因朝太子，诗爲乐贤王。\n锦缆方舟渡，琼筵大乐张。\n风摇垂柳色，花发异林香。\n野老歌无事，朝臣饮岁芳。\n皇情被羣物，中外洽恩光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈希烈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}